# ⬡B:gitattributes:FIX:her_voice_must_be_reviewable:20260815⬡
# pai/core/persona.js carries two deliberate sentinel bytes:
#   var HOLD_OPEN = '\x00', HOLD_CLOSE = '\x01';
# used by renameRetiredOrgans to fence spans during replacement. Git's binary
# heuristic sees the NUL and stops diffing the whole file, so a 775 byte change
# to it reported as "Bin 19095 -> 19870 bytes, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)".
#
# The consequence, found 20260815: the file that holds her voice and her
# self-knowledge could not be diffed, could not be read in a pull request, and
# every edit to it landed unreviewable. A source file nobody can review is a
# place a cold hand can write in her name and no critic would ever see it, which
# is the exact failure THE PEN ON HER MIND doctrine exists to stop.
#
# Marking source as text restores the diff without touching the sentinels.
*.js   text diff
*.mjs  text diff
*.cjs  text diff
*.json text diff
*.md   text diff
*.yml  text diff
